67 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 17 0 R/T(Centurion University is duly recognized as a pioneer in \217Skill Integrated Higher Education\216. Its unique model lays specific emphasis on creating sustainable livelihoods on a national scale in challenging geographies through education that results in employability and sparks entrepreneurship. This model has been recognized by multiple Governments \(Central and State\), International Organizations such as UNESCO and the World Bank as well as Policy Think-tanks such as the Niti Ayog. Recently, Centurion University\220s School of Vocational Education and Training has been recognized as a Center of Excellence by Ministry of Skill Development and Entrepreneurship, Government of India. It is the only University in India to be recognized as such.)/E(Centurion University is duly recognized as a pioneer in \217Skill Integrated Higher Education\216. Its unique model lays specific emphasis on creating sustainable livelihoods on a national scale in challenging geographies through education that results in employability and sparks entrepreneurship. This model has been recognized by multiple Governments \(Central and State\), International Organizations such as UNESCO and the World Bank as well as Policy Think-tanks such as the Niti Ayog. Recently, Centurion University\220s School of Vocational Education and Training has been recognized as a Center of Excellence by Ministry of Skill Development and Entrepreneurship, Government of India. It is the only University in India to be recognized as such.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

68 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 17 0 R/T(About the School  )/E(About the School  )/Pg 10 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

69 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 17 0 R/T(The School of Engineering and Technology \(SoET\), founded in 2008 at the Bhubaneswar campus and 2010 at the Paralakhemundi campus, is a premier institution dedicated to excellence in technical education, research, and innovation.The School of Engineering and Technology \(SoET\) follows an innovative pedagogy based on experiential learning, integrating technical knowledge and hands-on training to develop skilled engineers, creative thinkers, and effective problem solvers.)/E(The School of Engineering and Technology \(SoET\), founded in 2008 at the Bhubaneswar campus and 2010 at the Paralakhemundi campus, is a premier institution dedicated to excellence in technical education, research, and innovation.The School of Engineering and Technology \(SoET\) follows an innovative pedagogy based on experiential learning, integrating technical knowledge and hands-on training to develop skilled engineers, creative thinkers, and effective problem solvers.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

70 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 17 0 R/T(The AI Enabled Smart Solutions for Industry, Governance, Healthcare, and Sustainable Development \(AISIGH\205SD\) 2026 conference, organized by Centurion University of Technology and Management in collaboration with the IEEE Bhubaneswar Section, is a platform for researchers and professionals to explore advancements in artificial intelligence across diverse domains. Covering areas such as machine learning, IoT, computer vision, healthcare, industry, governance, and sustainability, the conference promotes innovation, collaboration, and the development of AI-driven solutions for real world challenges.)/E(The AI Enabled Smart Solutions for Industry, Governance, Healthcare, and Sustainable Development \(AISIGH\205SD\) 2026 conference, organized by Centurion University of Technology and Management in collaboration with the IEEE Bhubaneswar Section, is a platform for researchers and professionals to explore advancements in artificial intelligence across diverse domains. Covering areas such as machine learning, IoT, computer vision, healthcare, industry, governance, and sustainability, the conference promotes innovation, collaboration, and the development of AI-driven solutions for real world challenges.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[14]>>
